    <panel_attributes>title=SD03 Import a Job Manually, e.g. pasted LinkedIn posting (F05, F06 / UC05, UC06)
obj=Student~Student ACTOR
obj=:JobsPage~JPG
obj=:JobImportAPI~API
obj=:JobImportService~JIS
obj=:JobSourceRegistry~REG
obj=:ManualJobImportAdapter~MA
obj=:LLMClient~LLM
obj=:JobNormalizer~JN
obj=:DuplicateDetector~DD
obj=:JobRepository~JR

Student-&gt;&gt;&gt;JPG : 1: pasteJob(text, LINKEDIN)
text=Student:The student copies the posting\ntext themselves\;\nCareerPilot never fetches LinkedIn\npages.
JPG-&gt;&gt;&gt;API : 2: importManual(req); on=API
API-&gt;&gt;&gt;JIS : 3: importManual(userId, payload); on=JIS
JIS-&gt;&gt;&gt;REG : 4: getAdapter(MANUAL); on=REG
REG.&gt;JIS : 5: ManualJobImportAdapter; off=REG
JIS-&gt;&gt;&gt;MA : 6: parse(payload); on=MA
MA-&gt;&gt;&gt;LLM : 7: generateStructured("job.structure_paste",\nvars, rawJobSchema, userId); on=LLM
combinedFragment=alt~f1 JIS LLM; REG:[LLM unavailable or budget exceeded]
LLM.&gt;MA : 8: LLMUnavailableError
MA.&gt;JIS : 9: RawJobRecord(description = raw text, other\nfields empty)
text=JIS:GUI shows an editable form so the\nstudent completes title/company\nmanually
..=f1; REG:[success]
LLM.&gt;MA : 10: {title, company, location,\ndeadline, ...}; off=LLM
MA.&gt;JIS : 11: List&lt;RawJobRecord&gt; (sourceType label = LINKEDIN); off=MA
--=f1
JIS-&gt;&gt;&gt;MA : 12: validate(record)
JIS-&gt;&gt;&gt;JN : 13: normalize(raw, userId); on=JN
JN.&gt;JIS : 14: job (completeness = FULL); off=JN
JIS-&gt;&gt;&gt;DD : 15: findDuplicate(job); on=DD
DD-&gt;&gt;&gt;JR : 16: findByFingerprint(userId,\nfingerprint)
DD.&gt;JIS : 17: existing or null; off=DD
combinedFragment=alt~f2 JPG JR; API:[already imported]
JIS.&gt;API : 18: existing JobPosting (flag\nduplicate = true)
API.&gt;JPG : 19: 200 OK "already in your jobs"
..=f2; API:[new]
JIS-&gt;&gt;&gt;JR : 20: save(job)
JIS.&gt;API : 21: JobPosting; off=JIS
API.&gt;JPG : 22: 201 Created; off=API
--=f2
</panel_attributes>
